Fuel breakdown: {{ JSON.stringify($('JS - Estimate Offset Cost (optional)').item.json.fuelBreakdown) }} -> {{ $('JS - Estimate Offset Cost (optional)').item.json.fuelEmissionsKg }} kg CO2e
