Emission category: {{ $('JS - Estimate Offset Cost (optional)').item.json.emissionCategory }}

Return ONLY a JSON object (no markdown fences, no commentary) with keys: reportTitle (short), executiveSummary (2-3 sentences), keyMetrics (array of short strings, include the scope split), recommendations (array of 3-5 actionable strings), trend (one sentence, using the real trend data given if available, otherwise note no historical baseline), tags (array of short keyword strings).

